msgid "Batch-tests every strategy from the built-in corpus through an isolated NFQUEUE (YouTube / Telegram / Discord / Speedtest TLS handshakes) and ranks them by passed hosts + handshake speed. The service keeps running; applying a result switches Zapret to it."
