msgid "Profiles are matched in order (first match wins): scoped profiles run first, the general profile last. The server builds the final args, tests them on the isolated queue (Zapret) and through the local tester (ByeDPI); applying snapshots the previous strategies on the server, so Restore survives page reloads. ByeDPI scoped profiles are exact-domain and TCP-only (SNI in TLS-CHello/HTTP); QUIC/UDP is not domain-scoped and falls to the fallback group."
